60. The PNGRB’s functions are (under
Section 11
):
(a) registration of entities to market notified petroleum and its products that are
 subject to contract by Central government, and natural gas;
(b) registration of entities establishing and operating LPG terminals;
(c) registration to entities to set up storage facilities petroleum, its products, and
 natural gas, if it exceeds the capacity provided by regulations;
(d) Authorization of entities to lay, build, operate, or expand:
